  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You open your eyes; you stare at your half-finished plate of stew and
    stale bread. You are alone at your table.

    Around you hear adventurers merrily
    boasting about their deeds. But the only thing that you see is their COMRADERIE.
    A burning desire rises from within, which coalesces into a plan. You need their
    armor; only then can you be seen as equal to them.

'
